<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Converse reported raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Converse reported raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Converse Inc to speculative buy from speculative outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Converse was up 3-5/8 to 19-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
